    Bug 1925825 - Part 2 of 2 - Make nsMsgDBService::OpenDBFromFile() open the correct type of database. r=thunderbird-back-end-reviewers,darktrojan

    This also renames .openMailDBFromFile() to .openDBFromFile(), as it's no longer
    unconditionally creating an nsMailDatabase.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D237676

